From ed845e54ea589bc07e54f69fc298dc2bb3937a8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:45:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 094/109] feat(executorch): serve image-classification models
 on /v1/images/classify

et-server serves POST /classify/image with tflite-server's contract for a
model.pte directory whose manifest.json declares the image-classification
task. The executorch backend now detects that layout with the shared
classifier helper, refuses a model whose label and directory disagree at
load, answers the wrong route with 400 like tflite, and forwards images
through the same multipart call and error normalization. The descriptor
adds the image-classification mode; text models keep their layout and
behaviour.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
